WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:08.540
So... you ended up double-booking 
for that night?

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.420
They said it's a job. I 
can't really back out...

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.250
I'm sorry. I promised you guys
I'd play at the festival too.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.130
How can they schedule something
without even asking you?

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.370
What are you gonna do?

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.460
I want to do both!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.670
How?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.500
I'll... clone myself!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.590
Two O-Taes at once?

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.000
I want you to play with us too, O-Tae-chan!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.180
It's PoPiPa's first anniversary!

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.850
O-Tae! When does your show end?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.630
Let's think of a way for you to do both!

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:45.500
We can talk to Rinko-senpai and
Hina-san about it, okay?

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.880
I guess we can ask if it's possible
to shift the time schedule.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.130
We'll need to account for travel time
from the venue to school too.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.130
I'll look it up!

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.750
That means double rehearsals 
too. Can you do it?

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.500
Bring it on.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.880
All right! We're going to the 
culture festival together!

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:09.040
Po-Pi-Pa! Pi-Po-Pa! Po-Pi-Pa-Pa-Pi-Po-Pa!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.250
Pa!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:48.750
A live show?

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.080
Yes! The greatest band of all time,
produced by me, CHU2.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.380
And I want you to be present for 
our legendary, historic first

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:59.150
contact with the people of the world.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:05.880
Roselia could have been this big too,
if you'd taken me on as producer.

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:09.370
Bet you regret it now. Too bad, so sad!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.460
I have a culture festival to attend
on both of these days.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.330
Culture what...?

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:16.580
Right, then. Back to rehearsal.

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.630
Culture festival? What the heck!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:25.420
Seeing my band should be
way more of a priority than that...

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.390
Who cares about some festival!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.000
Hane-Saki-Sai
Haneoka Girls' Academy
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy
Double Culture Festival
Haneoka Girls' Academy

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.000
Today's the day! It's nice and sunny!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.000
This year will be the first ever double-whammy
for Haneoka and Hanasakigawa!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.330
C'mon, everybody...

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.250
let's have a boppin' time!

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:45.960
And with that, Haneoka girls, Hanasakigawa girls,
let the double festivities begin!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:49.330
Hane-Saki-Sai
Haneoka Girls' Academy
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy
Double Culture Festival

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.080
Now, reveal that which dwells 
within my right hand...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.580
uh, my stamp!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.540
Okay, you're good. Have fun!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.420
Check-In

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.290
This is where PoPiPa will be later...

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.670
Rokka, Ako, watch where you're going, okay?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.840
What's that?

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:07.180
Boo!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.000
A-Asuka-chan!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.170
Welcome to the Happy Haunted House!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.080
Kokoron!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.210
Happy Haunted House...?

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.210
The darkness is seeping into my very soul...

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.960
How cute!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.670
A haunted... café?

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:28.170
We felt bad that people are 
always afraid of ghosts,

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:32.000
so we made a cheerful, fun 
haunted house instead!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.790
How cute!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:44.960
Scientists have predicted that the Betelgeuse star
in the constellation Orion will go supernova...

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.330
This is pretty nice.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.330
Moca!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.220
Planetarium

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.710
Ahh, it's so quiet...

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:52.330
Reception

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:50.710
I'm gonna take a break!

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.330
See you in a bit.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:55.330
Bushido
Croquette Tea House

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.630
Bow your heads! On your knees!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.960
Do you not recognize your lord?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.670
Ka-kun, do you not recognize her?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.630
Aha!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.830
Now, present thyself!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.330
What the heck...?

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.460
Hey, I heard they're doing 
a Kaoru Café at Haneoka!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.920
Kaoru-sama is serving the customers!

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.710
Oh my gosh! Let's go!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.170
A fleeting moment just for you
Kaoru Café

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.170
Alas, it seems another of my little kittens
has gone astray.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.000
Come, my sweet.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.430
Yukina, why can't you just cheer up already?

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.290
I'm fairly certain I voted for a cat café.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:32.210
Well, this is a cat café.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.180
C'mon, meow.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.770
This is not what I signed up for...

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.630
Ahh, I'm mostly done now.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:44.250
Good work out there.
Thank you so much for all of your help.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:48.420
Not at all! You've had way more
on your plate than I have, Rinko-senpai...

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.250
You too, Hazawa-san.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.420
By the way, thanks a lot for shifting
the time schedule for us.

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.000
I'm looking forward to seeing 
PoPiPa perform later.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.420
'Kay! I'm gonna go see what my sis is up to!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.170
Z-z-zoom!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.170
Wh-what about the patrol...?
Z-z-zoom!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.130
Wh-what about the patrol...?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.830
Uh...

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.460
Why don't we head back for a bit as well?

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.040
Arisa!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.540
O-Tae said she just finished rehearsal.

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.080
Almost time for day one of 
their debut concerts, huh.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.130
I can't believe they're 
doing two days in a row!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.920
I wish I could have gone to see it.

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:24.170
There's always next time.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:26.290
Right now we've got our 
own show to worry about.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.750
Tomorrow...

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.790
I got them to move our 
performance to the very end,

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.000
so O-Tae should be able to
just make it after her concert's over.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.580
Thank goodness.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.630
Thanks.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.330
The stage is at Haneoka, right?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.630
Should we carry all of our stuff over there
before-hand and wait for her there?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.960
Yeah. We're the final act, we can't be late.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.670
We're gonna be fine, right?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.180
When you're in a pinch...

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:56.080
just give Hina-chan a call!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:56.920
Wha?!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.830
Senpai?!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.750
It's me, Hina-chan, my sisters!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.540
Happy New Year, dears!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.580
Long time no see, sweet peas!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:06.540
Hina-chan-senpai! What- How?!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:06.920
Well, it's our old school festival.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.630
Glitter*Green!
Well, it's our old school festival.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:12.790
Yuri's back from abroad for summer break,
so we all decided to come.

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.040
Looks like your surprise worked, Sis!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.040
Yay!

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.580
How're things going?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.460
It's been rough...

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.960
That's student council for you.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.670
You're so cute when you're
trying your best, Arisa-chan!

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:25.750
Hina, down!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.630
Where's Ol' Tae?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:32.010
She's a little busy right now,
but she'll be here tomorrow!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:36.250
Bummer. Guess the reunion with Debeko
will have to wait until then.

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:42.960
You said somethin' about a crowd?

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:46.380
CHU2-sama said they're calling in
reporters from the media too!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:49.030
Looks like our show's 
gonna be broadcasted live!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.460
Shouldn't the doors be open by now?

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:54.880
CHU2's probably doing some
final checks on the stage.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.500
We're about 15 minutes behind.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.500
She wants to make sure it's perfect.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:00.910
Of course!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.710
Layer, Masking, Pareo.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:07.460
Yes?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:11.540
The legend of our ultimate band
begins today, you guys.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.630
Hanazono!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:17.600
You may be a support member, but for right now,
in this moment, you're my guitarist.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.890
You're standing in the spotlight with us.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.830
I'll make them all shiver.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.830
O-Tae?

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.210
Aww, you're not gonna make it?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:33.210
Sorry, our meeting for 
tomorrow is running late.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.210
No worries.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:37.830
We'll do some extra practice for you, okay?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.170
Oh, Yuri-san and the girls 
are gonna come see us!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.460
Sounds like the festival's been a lot of fun.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.080
How 'bout you? Did you have fun performing?

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:49.750
Yeah, it was pretty 
awesome. I got goosebumps!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.750
Kasumi?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.250
I'm super excited for our show!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.590
Same. Can't wait for PoPiPa.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.580
We'll be waiting!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.540
I'll send you a vid of the 
rehearsal later, okay?

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.710
Let's keep this energy up for day two
of the festival tomorrow!

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.330
Make sure you come check 
out the festivities at 2-B!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.670
We're doing an exhibit!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.420
The History of Hanasakigawa
A Glimpse of Our City

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.250
Come see our presentation!

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.130
It is said that the Kanda River
used to flow as you see here.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:27.290
History of Hanasakigawa (5)
Blue: Current river flow
Red: Past river flow

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:28.460
Now, I'd like to highlight some of the
historical figures of this area.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:34.500
Shigenobu Okuma was born in Saga prefecture
and became the Minister of Foreign Affairs at...

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.500
Dense stuff...

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:38.040
Wow...

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.380
This looks pretty different than ours, huh!

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:44.170
A-chan said they're working the booths today!
Let's go check it out!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:47.210
Hey, let's go put our stuff 
down first, you guys!

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.080
Open to everyone!
Solo players and beginners welcome!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.330
Take your time!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.790
We're next!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.540
S-Sis!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.880
Yoo-hoo! We're here!

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.380
Wow, we can borrow instruments here?

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.630
What a cool idea to do a session café.

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.710
It was Rokka's idea, since we have

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:07.710
Ako and some other students 
who can play instruments too.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:11.710
All right, now let's try the whole thing,
just like I taught you.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.050
Oh, they're starting.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.510
Look who it is. Poppin' Party.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.720
The elders?!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.920
We're doing a session.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:23.180
Sessions are the best.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:25.290
Bands performing at the double culture festival,
please use this as your green room!

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:27.330
It's almost your turn, huh.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:28.580
Yeah...

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.920
Where's O-Tae-chan?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:35.000
Mmm... I haven't heard from her.

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:48.500
S-sweet! Excellent! Unstoppable!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:52.130
The legend of RAISE A 
SUILEN has finally begun!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.550
You exaggerate too much, man.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.750
PoPiPa!
Kasumi: Afterglow's performance
was super cool.
PoPiPa!
Rimi: 3 more bands left.
Aya-senpai's band is really cute.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.180
PoPiPa!
Saaya: How's it going, O-Tae? Are you gonna make it in time?

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:01.960
Hana-chan.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:02.830
Mhmm.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:10.210
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.580
Look, they still want more!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:16.420
I'm already breathless as it is!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.750
Quit complaining and let's go.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:19.960
Coming!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.460
Fine then...

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:27.830
Let's go.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:35.380
Boppin'
What is this?
4 Flamingo
Aya-chan's band!! Do your best, Tsugu!
5 Double Culture Festival Session Band!
Lisa-sama!!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.710
How're you feelin', everyone?!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.090
Are you ready for more?!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.550
Yeah!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:45.920
Please be on standby here until
the session band is finished performing.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.710
When they're on their last song-

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.250
PoPiPa! You ready?

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.630
Sorry, we're still waiting on O-Tae.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.830
What is she doing? We're up next...

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.080
Green Room

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.580
A three-song encore?!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:05.790
I can't move my legs...

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.130
Nice work, you guys.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.920
Did she just leave in her costume...?

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.500
Think her show ran late?
What if she had an accident?!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.080
What? Is she okay?

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.420
Tae-senpai...

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.790
She'll be fine.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.510
It's her!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.350
Rimi: 3 more bands left.
Aya-senpai's band is really cute.
PoPiPa!
Saaya: How's it going, O-Tae?
Are you gonna make it in time?
PoPiPa!
Tae: Just finished, on my way!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:29.040
Huh?! She'll never make it!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.630
Sh-should we let the audience know
and have them wait?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:35.710
What? We don't even know 
how late she's gonna be.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.670
PasuPare could perform...

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:41.790
What? I thought your management 
said you couldn't.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.170
Oh, that's right!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.200
Can't wait for PoPiPa.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:50.920
Kasumi!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.120
I'm gonna go get O-Tae!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.170
We need to get everything ready!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:56.750
Okay!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.710
Guess we need to buy some time!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.590
Yeah!

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:06.090
Congrats on your first year!!
Our first anniversary
Let's do our best!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.350
Thanks, everyone!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:15.050
Thank you for letting us 
form this special band

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:17.560
for our last high school culture festival!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:21.000
This has been the greatest day ever!

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:23.250
Thank you so much!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:27.250
Up next, it's the final act of the festival!

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:30.420
Today, we're celebrating their one-year...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.410
Buy us some time

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.370
Huh?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.830
Do somethin' boppin'!!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.080
WHAT?!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.210
Uh... Um... The one-year...

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.300
one-year, uh...

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.420
What?! Tae-chan's not here yet?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.100
What?! Tae-chan's not here yet?
It's been 365 days, or in other words, a year...

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.040
Kasumi just ran off to get her.
It's been 365 days, or in other words, a year...

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.920
Uh-oh.
It's been 365 days, or in other words, a year...

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.630
And now poor Aya-san is stuck out there...
It's been 365 days, or in other words, a year...

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:00.210
It's been 365 days, or 
in other words, a year...

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.750
and, um...

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:02.860
You've got this!

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.880
Where's PoPiPa?

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.420
Hang on. I see Shirokane-san.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.710
Where? Where?
Hold still...

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.670
Having technical difficulties...?

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.210
This isn't very boppin'...

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.750
I'll be right back!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.540
What?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.290
Rin-rin, what's going on?

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.250
Ako-chan!

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.920
We need to start, even 
if it's the three of us-

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.540
That would be stupid!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.580
But-

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.210
I'm getting worried...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.090
What?

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.430
We're gonna get through this, right...?

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.830
I'll be right back!

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.290
Lock?!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:38.170
Want to hear a story about 
our cotton candy stand...?

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.460
Th-thank you, everyone!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.710
Lock-chan!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.210
What's she thinking?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:47.290
I'm Rokka Asahi, first year at Haneoka!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.120
I'm gonna play some guitar for you!

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:13.680
Rokka's amazing!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.720
Whoa!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:15.880
She's good...

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.170
Is she human?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.170
Wooo!!

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.750
Who is that?!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.880
That was rad!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.250
She's crazy!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:55.080
Encore! Encore!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.580
Wha...?! An e-encore?!

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:00.930
Rokka!

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.170
That was pretty awesome!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.170
Let's go.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:09.540
Okay.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.290
Shirokane-senpai...

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.380
I'll be right back.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.330
Wha...?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:16.540
Lisa!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.500
Well? What now?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.460
Let's play until the rest of PoPiPa get here.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.830
Roger that.

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:27.290
Huh?

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.000
Don't just start without me.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.750
Roselia's songs have to be perfect
every time, no exceptions.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.460
Does anyone have a guitar?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:38.420
Sis!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.930
Use mine!

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.580
Guess I don't have a choice.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:44.790
Sis!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:47.880
Well then...

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.000
Will you give us a listen for a while?

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.290
You rocked up here.

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.670
Leave the rest to us.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:16:59.960
Okay!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:35.920
O-Tae!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.040
Kasumi!

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.920
Roselia!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.750
O-Tae-chan, Kasumi-chan...

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:59.250
Kasumi-senpai, Tae-senpai...

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:31.710
School Festival Symphony

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:27.420
Everyone, thanks to your cooperation
and our amazing community,

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:31.910
our two-day double culture festival
has come to a successful close.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.790
Thank you all so much.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.290
Thanks, Prez!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.420
It was so much fun!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.130
N-no, thank you!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.500
Rin-rin!

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.390
You were an awesome class president!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.880
Here, Sis.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.000
Nice work today.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.750
Yeah, and it was exhausting.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:57.210
Somehow I always get dragged into
your crazy schemes.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:01.330
Well, I was excited to do 
this festival with you, Sis.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.960
Lots of good memories.

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.660
...Though I'm kinda sad about PoPiPa.

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:10.790
Now then, let's celebrate the 
success of our festival...

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.460
with a nice big cheer from all of us.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.710
Everyone, cheers!

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:19.210
Cheers!

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.790
A-Arisa!

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:38.080
Next episode: R-I-O-T
